# Derived-artefact archives. gauntlet/reference/pairs/ is ignored as a directory, but a zip of it
# sits BESIDE that directory and so was not covered — a 48MB binary that `git add -A` would have
# swept into the repo. Added 2026-09-03 after exactly that near-miss.
gauntlet/reference/*.zip

# The Astra approved package's bulk provenance: model/ (the 3q source GLB and the locked
# correction bins), tools/ and previews/. Moved out of the asset tree 2026-09-21 on Eric's
# instruction — 36 MB that the game never loads and that publicDir would otherwise copy into
# dist/ on every build. The files are still on disk here and their hashes are still recorded in
# assets/LICENCES.md and PACKAGE_HASHES.json, so the chain stays auditable.
astra_archive/
